MEET CEREBRAL VALLEY

Hi Kraisorn, welcome to CV. We bring together the =
people building AI, from founders and developers to leading labs. Here's =
how to get involved.


EVENTS

Discover hackathons, meetups, and demos =
around the world. Find something near you or join an event online. Browse =
events https://cerebralvalley.ai/events.


SERVICES

We run AI hackathons and private enterprise events, from build days to =
workshops and demos. For AI infrastructure projects, we connect you with =
land, power, chips, and partners. Our services https://cerebralvalley.=
ai/about.


NEWSLETTER

Our newsletter covers the people building AI, with =
founder interviews, community news, and upcoming events. Read more =
https://cerebralvalley.ai/newsletter.

See you soon,

